<section class="pv-transport-discovery" aria-labelledby="transport-discovery-heading"><h2 id="transport-discovery-heading">Flight options</h2><p class="pv-flight-date-summary"><strong>Travel-date availability is not verified.</strong> These are published route suggestions. Use Check dates to see current results for your trip.</p><% if(discovery.passengerRoutes?.length){ %><div class="pv-discovery-grid"><% discovery.passengerRoutes.forEach(route=>{ %><article class="pv-itinerary-card pv-passenger-first pv-flight-option" data-airline-name="<%= route.airline %>" data-flight-from="<%= route.from %>" data-flight-to="<%= route.to %>"><p class="pv-eyebrow"><%= route.airline %></p><p class="pv-flight-date-status">Dates not verified</p><h3><%= route.from %> → <%= route.to %></h3><p>Pet travel: check with the airline</p><a class="pv-button" href="<%= route.priceUrl || route.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check dates &amp; prices ↗</a><div class="pv-flight-policy-links"><a class="pv-country-policy" href="<%= typeof plan!=='undefined' && /^\/country\/[^?#]+\?petType=[a-z0-9-]+$/.test(plan.countryUrl || '') ? plan.countryUrl : '/getCountryRegulationList' %>">Country requirements</a><a class="pv-airline-policy" href="/regulations/airlineList">Browse airline policies</a></div><p class="pv-fine-print">Published route · checked <%= route.reviewedAt %>. Schedule, price and pet-space availability have not been confirmed.</p></article><% }) %></div><% } %><% if(discovery.candidates.length){ %><div class="pv-note"><h3>Your dog’s separate transport to Australia</h3><p>Ordinary pet dogs enter through the manifest-cargo pathway. Plan their Melbourne arrival separately from your passenger ticket.</p><% discovery.candidates.forEach(candidate=>{ %><p><strong><%= candidate.name %>: <%= candidate.originAirportName %> → <%= candidate.animalEntryAirportName %></strong></p><a href="<%= candidate.enquiryUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ask about pet cargo ↗</a><% }) %></div><% } %><p class="pv-fine-print">Route options, not confirmed flight offers. Check current prices and pet acceptance with the airline.</p></section><script src="/airport-handoff.js" defer></script>
